  "story_text_placeholder": "Story text coming soon.",
  "story_page_1": "Gatotkaca , the king of the Kingdom of Pringgadani. He inherited extraordinary strength from both his parents: his father, Bimasena, is a Pandava renowned for his immense physical power, and his mother, Dewi Arimbi, is a giantess from Pringgadani. Gatotkaca can soar through the skies at great speed, and carries sacred heirlooms ready to fight into battle.",
  "story_page_2": "Conquer new territories and expand the Kingdom of Pringgadani. Build these structures to prepare your kingdom for war:",
  "story_building_pendopo_title": "PENDOPO",
  "story_building_pendopo_description": "Gatotkaca's place to recover and heal. It is the key to dominion: the war ends when no pendopo remains.",
  "story_building_tower_title": "TOWER",
  "story_building_tower_description": "Archers rain a relentless barrage of attacks on your enemies from here.",
  "story_building_gold_mine_title": "GOLD MINE",
  "story_building_gold_mine_description": "Produces gold to prepare you for your next battle.",
  "story_building_barrack_title": "BARRACKS",
  "story_building_barrack_description": "Train soldiers here and assign them to accompany Gatotkaca in battle.",
  "story_page_3": "Fight for power against the Kurawa. Improve Gatotkaca's abilities and become an invincible king—but beware: the Kurawa have warriors every bit as powerful as he is.",
  "story_page_4": "Kala Pracona , the monster king of Trabelasuket and a tyrannical ruler.",
  "story_page_5": "Bisma , a senior commander of the Kurawa forces, highly skilled with many weapons, including the bow and arrow.",
  "story_page_6": "Aswatama , Gatotkaca's eternal rival. The son of the great teacher Resi Drona and Dewi Kripi, he is consumed by a desire for revenge after his father is killed by the Pandawa.",
  "story_page_7": "Karna , possesses extraordinary supernatural powers as an incarnation of Batara Surya. Born of a forbidden relationship, he was abandoned by the Pandawa and raised by the Kurawa. Though he knew the Pandawa were his brothers, Karna chose to remain with the Kurawa, who had raised him.",
  "story_page_8": "As Gatotkaca, conquer, defend, and expand the dominion of the Kingdom of Pringgadani!",
